DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
6333::$$$message_0045_0000_0000$$$::"[humming]"[lr]::
6334::$$$message_0045_0000_0001$$$::It's a bright and clear morning. I leisurely make my way up the mountain steps.[lr]::
6335::$$$message_0045_0000_0002$$$::The sunlight filtering through the trees and the refreshing, cool mountain air imparts a sense of calm.[lr]::
6336::$$$message_0045_0000_0003$$$::Today is a perfect day for a stroll through the woods. I even find myself whistling cheerfully.::
6337::$$$message_0045_0001_0000$$$::Just as I'm thinking that...[lr]::
6338::$$$message_0045_0001_0001$$$::I come across an unexpected person who doesn't match the atmosphere at all.::
6339::$$$message_0045_0002_0000$$$::"Leys? What are you doing all the way out here?"[lr]::
6340::$$$message_0045_0002_0001$$$::Just ahead of me are the woods behind Ryudou Temple, and a plateau with an expansive view of the forest on the outskirts of Fuyuki.[lr]::
6341::$$$message_0045_0002_0002$$$::Surely, she didn't walk all the way here from the castle...::
6342::$$$message_0045_0003_0000$$$::"Hellooo? Morning, Leys!"[lr]::
6343::$$$message_0045_0003_0001$$$::"...Ah. Good morning, Shirou."[lr]::
6344::$$$message_0045_0003_0002$$$::Leysritt walks intently over to me.[lr]::
6345::$$$message_0045_0003_0003$$$::Her words sound blunt, but the way she moves reminds me of a child.[lr]::
6346::$$$message_0045_0003_0004$$$::Like the kind of kid who warms up to anyone she meets.::
6347::$$$message_0045_0004_0000$$$::"Hey. Funny seeing you here."[lr]::
6348::$$$message_0045_0004_0001$$$::"...Yeah. It's my first time at the temple... Do you come here a lot?"[lr]::
6349::$$$message_0045_0004_0002$$$::"Hmm... More often than not, I guess. A friend lives here, so I come hang out even when I don't have any business.[lr]::
6350::$$$message_0045_0004_0003$$$::What about you, Leys? I know you said it's your first time here. Are you on an errand?"::
6351::$$$message_0045_0005_0000$$$::"...Not an errand, but I sensed something bad here, so I stopped by to take care of it."[lr]::
6352::$$$message_0045_0005_0001$$$::"Take care of it?"[lr]::
6353::$$$message_0045_0005_0002$$$::"...Yeah. To put it in its place."::
6354::$$$message_0045_0006_0000$$$::The maid gestures as if strangling a bird in her hands.[lr]::
6355::$$$message_0045_0006_0001$$$::Terrifying.[lr]::
6356::$$$message_0045_0006_0002$$$::What's scary is that she doesn't sound like she's joking.::
6357::$$$message_0045_0007_0000$$$::"...Uh, hold on. What exactly is this bad thing?"[lr]::
6358::$$$message_0045_0007_0001$$$::"...............[wait canskip=0 time=1600][say storage=ryu0204_riz_0040 name=リズ]Want to see?"[lr]::
6359::$$$message_0045_0007_0002$$$::The conversation skips a step ahead...![lr]::
6360::$$$message_0045_0007_0003$$$::Urgh, before you show me, I'd like to know what exactly this dangerous thing is.::
6361::$$$message_0045_0008_0000$$$::"Um...is it something I can see?"[lr]::
6362::$$$message_0045_0008_0001$$$::"...............[wait canskip=0 time=1600][say storage=ryu0204_riz_0050 name=リズ]Want it?"[lr]::
6363::$$$message_0045_0008_0002$$$::Leysritt skips the conversation another, no, two steps ahead.[lr]::
6364::$$$message_0045_0008_0003$$$::We're already at the top of the figurative stairs. There's nowhere else to take this discussion.::
6365::$$$message_0045_0009_0000$$$::"Umm... Do you have it with you now?"[lr]::
6366::$$$message_0045_0009_0001$$$::"I found it over there.[lr]::
6367::$$$message_0045_0009_0002$$$::I was looking for it because I thought it might be Illya's enemy, but it smells like Illya, too.[cacheimage storage=リズ01b(中),リズ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=リズ01b(中)][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=リズ01a(中)] How mysterious."[lr]::
6368::$$$message_0045_0009_0003$$$::Leys extends a hand.[lr]::
6369::$$$message_0045_0009_0004$$$::"Oh, thanks."[lr]::
6370::$$$message_0045_0009_0005$$$::I grab it reflexively.::
6371::$$$message_0045_0010_0000$$$::"...?"[lr]::
6372::$$$message_0045_0010_0001$$$::Is this a...hanafuda card?[lr]::
6373::$$$message_0045_0010_0002$$$::I've acquired something like a tarot card made from cloth.::
6374::$$$message_0045_0011_0000$$$::"Did you find this around here?"[lr]::
6375::$$$message_0045_0011_0001$$$::"It was buried. A long time ago, I'm sure. At least two hundred years ago."[lr]::
6376::$$$message_0045_0011_0002$$$::"Wow. That's older than the Holy Grail War!"[lr]::
6377::$$$message_0045_0011_0003$$$::Doesn't that make this an important archaeological find?[lr]::
6378::$$$message_0045_0011_0004$$$::Actually, I have my doubts it could be more than two centuries old, but I'll come back to that later.::
6379::$$$message_0045_0012_0000$$$::"Thanks, Leys. I'll take it, but...are you sure you want to give me this?"[lr]::
6380::$$$message_0045_0012_0001$$$::"It's okay. I think it was destiny that we met here.[lr]::
6381::$$$message_0045_0012_0002$$$::I'm glad you like it, Shirou."[lr]::
6382::$$$message_0045_0012_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
6383::$$$message_0045_0012_0004$$$::That catches me a little off guard.[lr]::
6384::$$$message_0045_0012_0005$$$::It's super-effective, coming from Leys, who isn't very expressive.::
6385::$$$message_0045_0013_0000$$$::"I'm going back to the castle. You should come over to play sometime, Shirou."[lr]::
6386::$$$message_0045_0013_0001$$$::Leys turns back the way we[line len=2]No, she steps into the forest.[lr]::
6387::$$$message_0045_0013_0002$$$::...I didn't want to think about it, but it seems like she really walked all the way here from the castle.::
6388::$$$message_0045_0014_0000$$$::"Okay. See ya later, Leys."[lr]::
6389::$$$message_0045_0014_0001$$$::"Yeah... Be careful, Shirou.[lr]::
6390::$$$message_0045_0014_0002$$$::Misfortune will befall you if you keep that with you."[lr]::
6391::$$$message_0045_0014_0003$$$::"Wha[line len=2]you gave me a cursed item!?"[lr]::
6392::$$$message_0045_0014_0004$$$::"Fu... [wvl][move textoff=0 time=140 path=(371,124,255)(371,107,255)(371,126,255)(371,107,255)(383,126,255)(388,110,255)(398,126,255)(411,112,255)(427,125,255)(434,112,255)(449,125,255)(459,113,255)(475,125,255)(485,113,200)(501,122,155)(511,113,100)(524,120,0) storage=リズ02a(遠) accel=0]Fu fu fu fu."[lr]::
6393::$$$message_0045_0014_0005$$$::Leys fades into the forest, leaving me with a chuckle that's anything but pleasant.::
6394::$$$message_0045_0015_0000$$$::"...What the heck do I do with this?"[lr]::
6395::$$$message_0045_0015_0001$$$::I look at the mysterious card.[lr]::
6396::$$$message_0045_0015_0002$$$::It could come in handy...maybe.[lr]::
6397::$$$message_0045_0015_0003$$$::I can imagine the disaster that might befall me if I toss it here and she comes back.[lr]::
6398::$$$message_0045_0015_0004$$$::I'll just stick it in my back pocket for now. Out of sight, out of mind.::
906343::$$$message_9045_0003_0001$$$::"...Ah. Good morning, Shirou."[r]T�A